ironment-agency.gov.uk", "url": "https://consult.environment-agency.gov.uk/psc/ip10-0ht-valencia-waste-management-limited/supporting_documents/Application%20Variation%20Habitats%20risk%20assessment%20V009%2014112023.pdf"}, {"title": "snettisham quarry contaminated land inspection report", "url": "https://www.west-norfolk.gov.uk/download/downloads/id/3688/snettisham_quarry_contaminated_land_inspection_report.pdf"}, {"title": "dersingham pit contaminated land inspection report", "url": "https://www.west-norfolk.gov.uk/download/downloads/id/3743/dersingham_pit_contaminated_land_inspection_report.pdf"}, {"title": "Burial of geological SSSI allowed", "url": "https://www.mineralandwasteplanning.co.uk/burial-geological-sssi-allowed/industrial-minerals/article/1324395"}, {"title": "application variation v002 appendix 4 final 20032025docx", "url": "https://consult.environment-agency.gov.uk/psc/ta7-0js-towens-of-weston-ltd-epr-hb3004ks-v003/supporting_documents/application-variation-v002-appendix-4-final-20032025docx"}, {"title": "consult.environment-agency.gov.uk", "url": "https://consult.environment-agency.gov.uk/psc/pr6-7dt-quercia-limited/supporting_documents/Application%20%20Variation%20V009%20%20ESID%20addendum%20cell%204B%20extension%20only.pdf"}, {"title": "Sites of Special Scientific Interest (SSSI)", "url": "https://www.wigan.gov.uk/Resident/Leisure/Greenheart/SSSI/Index.aspx"}, {"title": "05   09 0761W Danes Moss", "url": "https://moderngov.cheshireeast.gov.uk/documents/s3430/05 - 09-0761W Danes Moss.pdf"}, {"title": "- Latest available (Revised)", "url": "https://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2002/1559/schedule/2/paragraph/1/2002-06-15"}]}, "The search didn't find the year the Siu Lang Shui site was designated as a Site of Special Scientific Interest (SSSI), so I can't answer that part from these results.\n\nThe only relevant result is a 2016 Hong Kong Legislative Council written reply. It notes that Siu Lang Shui contains a butterfly reserve that has been listed as an SSSI, but it gives no date for the designation. The same reply describes the area's road access and the nearby West New Territories Landfill, which is the closest link to the landfill in your query. The other results concern SSSIs in the UK and do not mention Siu Lang Shui.\n\nTo pin down the year, I'd suggest checking Hong Kong's Agriculture, Fisheries and Conservation Department, which manages SSSI records, or the Legislative Council's archives for earlier references to the designation."], "durationSeconds": 5.617060041999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_016KrDNVq3AqTzymCxk6MpPz", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
