{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01QLh8YP1NzCESiP1qRn94rb", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Site_of_Special_Scientific_Interest_(Hong_Kong)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.scmp.com/news/hong-kong/health-environment/article/3359492/commercial-fish-farm-encroaches-government-land-and-deemed-ecological-threat\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.tpb.gov.hk/sc/forms/Schedule_Notes/msn_sssi_c.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.epd.gov.hk/eia/chi/register/permit/latest/figure/vep6302023figure3.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.epd.gov.hk/eia/register/permit/latest/figure/vep6072021figure3.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.circularonline.co.uk/news/investigation-launched-into-sickening-30000-tonne-waste-dump/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://ero.ontario.ca/comment/96418\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.epd.gov.hk/epd/sc_chi/environmentinhk/eia_planning/sea2005/files/disposal_site_exesum.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://waihekegulfnews.co.nz/landfill-proposed-near-relatively-pristine-te-matuku-marine-reserve/\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:51:04.236Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "小冷水 具特殊科學價值地點 年 漁農自然護理署 堆填區", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01CmfjYzAV21toPCVuXBoaBu", "content": [{"title": "Site of Special Scientific Interest (Hong Kong)", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Site_of_Special_Scientific_Interest_(Hong_Kong)"}, {"title": "commercial fish farm encroaches government land and deemed ecological threat", "url": "https://www.scmp.com/news/hong-kong/health-environment/article/3359492/commercial-fish-farm-encroaches-government-land-and-deemed-ecological-threat"}, {"title": "msn sssi c", "url": "https://www.tpb.gov.hk/sc/forms/Schedule_Notes/msn_sssi_c.pdf"}, {"title": "www.epd.gov.hk", "url": "https://www.epd.gov.hk/eia/chi/register/permit/latest/figure/vep6302023figure3.pdf"}, {"title": "www.epd.gov.hk", "url": "https://www.epd.gov.hk/eia/register/permit/latest/figure/vep6072021figure3.pdf"}, {"title": "Investigation launched into ‘sickening’ 30,000-tonne waste dump", "url": "https://www.circularonline.co.uk/news/investigation-launched-into-sickening-30000-tonne-waste-dump/"}, {"title": "ero.ontario.ca", "url": "https://ero.ontario.ca/comment/96418"}, {"title": "disposal site exesum", "url": "https://www.epd.gov.hk/epd/sc_chi/environmentinhk/eia_planning/sea2005/files/disposal_site_exesum.pdf"}, {"title": "landfill proposed near relatively pristine te matuku marine reserve", "url": "https://waihekegulfnews.co.nz/landfill-proposed-near-relatively-pristine-te-matuku-marine-reserve/"}]}, "The search did not find a source confirming that 小冷水 (Siu Lang Shui) is designated as a 具特殊科學價值地點 (Site of Special Scientific Interest, SSSI), nor the year of any such designation.\n\nWhat the results do cover:\n\n- **SSSI general background:** A Wikipedia entry describes SSSIs as areas in Hong Kong protected for wildlife, habitats and geographic features. The Agriculture, Fisheries and Conservation Department identifies them, and the Planning Department records them on maps. The same entry says 67 locations were designated from 1975 to 2005, and it lists some sites as later delisted. Its list does not mention Siu Lang Shui in the excerpt returned.\n- **Planning zoning:** A Town Planning Board schedule notes for the \"Site of Special Scientific Interest\" zone say its purpose is to preserve and protect areas of scientific value, and that development there is generally presumed inappropriate.\n- **Siu Lang Shui landfill:** Environmental Protection Department permit documents refer to the \"restored Siu Lang Shui Landfill\" as a consultation zone for a fill bank expansion at Tuen Mun Area 38. These documents concern landfill expansion and do not mention an SSSI designation.\n\nTo answer the question, check the AFCD's SSSI list and the Planning Department's SSSI register directly. Those should give the designation status and year for Siu Lang Shui, if it has one."], "durationSeconds": 6.405517583000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01QLh8YP1NzCESiP1qRn94rb", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
